==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Galarian form]] of {{p|Zigzagoon}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Galarian Zigzagoon|117}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Dig Claws''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Growlithe|89}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

